# Revisions git blame should look straight through.
#
# A commit that reformats or renames across the whole tree buries the
# history of every line it touches: blame stops at the sweep instead of
# at the change that put the logic there. Listing it here fixes that.
#
# Enable it once per clone (it cannot be committed as a repo setting):
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Only ever add a commit whose diff cannot change behaviour.

